The key to piloting Tifa Lockhart is understanding its core engine: Tifa Lockhart doubles her power on every single land drop. With trample built-in, a single fetchland turns her from 2 power to 8 power, and a Scapeshift or double land drop easily hits 32+ power for one-shot commander knockouts.
This is a Bracket 3 build running three Game Changers: Crop Rotation, The One Ring, Worldly Tutor. It contains zero mass land denial and focuses on high-synergy board development, interactive answers, and an inevitable endgame clock.

# Commander and Core Synergy
Tifa Lockhart :: primary commander driving the deck's core strategy
Scapeshift :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Azusa, Lost but Seeking :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Exploration :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Lotus Cobra :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Tireless Provisioner :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage

# High-Impact Engines and Support
Conduit of Worlds :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Ramunap Excavator :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Heroic Intervention :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Sylvan Safekeeper :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Unnatural Growth :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion

# Game Changers and Interaction
Crop Rotation :: high-power Game Changer providing irreplaceable tempo, draw, or board control
The One Ring :: high-power Game Changer providing irreplaceable tempo, draw, or board control
Worldly Tutor :: high-power Game Changer providing irreplaceable tempo, draw, or board control
Beast Within :: efficient interaction and acceleration keeping the table in check
Sol Ring :: efficient interaction and acceleration keeping the table in check
